# bolt_mote - a near-zero mesh for the storm-lightning Typhons (venus_world.py). A Typhon
# cannot be scaled, so its body is swapped for this: one tiny triangle, effectively invisible.
mtllib bolt_mote.mtl
v 0 0 0
v 0.5 0 0
v 0 0 0.5
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 0 1
vn 0 1 0
usemtl bolt_mote
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1
